        <mxCell id='r_facts' value='&lt;b&gt;IMPLEMENTATION FACTS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Customer and funeral-shop owner accounts use the &lt;b&gt;user&lt;/b&gt; role; a shop owner is identified by the related verified funeral-shop record. There is no separate staff role.&lt;br&gt;• Administrative access uses &lt;b&gt;funeral_admin&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;admin&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;super_admin&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• GCash/e-wallet payments use submitted details, reference numbers and proof images for manual review; no online payment-gateway API is active.&lt;br&gt;• Expo is the external push-delivery service. Maps and blood-related functions are not part of this system.' style='rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#A78BFA;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#2E1065;fontSize=16;shadow=1;arcSize=10;' vertex='1' parent='r1'>
          <mxGeometry x='90' y='930' width='2420' height='320' as='geometry'/>
        </mxCell>
